Domain Entity Section
    documentation 'This entity represents a setting in which organized instruction of course 
                  'content is provided, in-person or otherwise, to one or more students for a given 
                  'period of time. A course offering may be offered to more than one section.
    allow primary key updates
    string UniqueSectionCode
        documentation 'A unique identifier for the Section that is defined by the classroom, 
                      'the subjects taught, and the instructors who are assigned.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
        min length 1
        max length 255
    integer SequenceOfCourse
        documentation 'When a section is part of a sequence of parts for a course, the number of the 
                      'sequence. If the course has only one part, the value of this section attribute 
                      'should be 1.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
        min value 1
        max value 8
    enumeration EducationalEnvironment
        documentation 'The setting in which a child receives education and related services; 
                      'for example:
                      '
                      'Center-based instruction
                      '
                      'Home-based instruction
                      '
                      'Hospital class
                      '
                      'Mainstream
                      '
                      'Residential care and treatment facility
                      '
                      '...
        is optional
    enumeration MediumOfInstruction
        documentation 'The media through which teachers provide instruction to students and students 
                      'and teachers communicate about instructional matters; for example:
                      '
                      'Technology-based instruction in classroom
                      '
                      'Correspondence instruction
                      '
                      'Face-to-face instruction
                      '
                      'Virtual/On-line Distance learning
                      '
                      'Center-based instruction
                      '
                      '...
        is optional
    enumeration PopulationServed
        documentation 'The type of students the Section is offered and tailored to; for example:
                      '
                      'Bilingual students
                      '
                      'Remedial education students
                      '
                      'Gifted and talented students
                      '
                      'Career and Technical Education students
                      '
                      'Special education students
                      '
                      '...
        is optional
    include Credits
        documentation 'The amount of credit available to a student who successfully meets the 
                      'objectives of the course. AvailableCredits are measured in Carnegie units, A 
                      'course meeting every day for one period of the school day over the span of a 
                      'school year offers one Carnegie unit. See publication: U.S. Department of 
                      'Education, NCES, 2007-341, Secondary School Course Classification System: School 
                      'Codes for the Exchange of Data (SCED).
        is optional
        with context Available
    descriptor SectionCharacteristic
        documentation 'Reflects important characteristics of the Section, such as whether or not 
                      'attendance is taken and the Section is graded.
        is optional collection
    descriptor Language
        documentation 'The primary language of instruction, if omitted English is assumed.
        is optional
        with context Instruction
    reference CourseOffering
        documentation 'The course offering taught in the Section.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    reference School
        documentation 'The school where the Section is taught.
        is required
        is queryable field
    reference Location
        documentation 'The location, typically a classroom, where the Section meets.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    reference ClassPeriod
        documentation 'The class period during which the Section meets.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    reference Program
        documentation 'Optional reference to program (e.g., CTE) to which the Section is associated.
        is optional collection
